# src/linux_soc/package/ = the board bring-up bundle: large, fully
# regenerable BINARIES (bitstream, XSA, kernel Image, OpenSBI, rootfs, DTB).
# These are byte copies of build artifacts (hw/build + linux/artifacts) and
# total ~320 MB — they must NEVER bloat the git diff. Restage them with the
# package step in the runbook.
#
# Track ONLY the small, commit-worthy evidence: MANIFEST.txt (artifact list +
# sha256 + provenance) and this .gitignore. That is enough to audit exactly
# what a bring-up used and to re-fetch/rebuild it.
*
!.gitignore
!MANIFEST.txt
!MANIFEST.sha256
!README*
